// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2017-01-10
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685.005, car.2016-04-002
// Description: One of the Windows Eventlogs has been cleared. e.g. caused by "wevtutil cl" command execution
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((EventID EQ "104" AND Provider_Name EQ "Microsoft-Windows-Eventlog") AND NOT (((Channel EQ "Microsoft-Windows-PowerShell/Operational" OR Channel EQ "Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" OR Channel EQ "PowerShellCore/Operational" OR Channel EQ "Security" OR Channel EQ "System" OR Channel EQ "Windows PowerShell"))))
